sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant A as App
  participant C as CellarDoor
  participant E as Entra ID
  U->>A: open app
  A->>C: no session, start sign-in
  C->>C: make state, nonce, PKCE verifier
  C->>E: authorize (code, challenge, state, nonce)
  E->>U: sign in, consent
  U->>C: redirect with code and state
  C->>C: check state
  C->>E: exchange code plus verifier
  E-->>C: ID token
  C->>C: verify signature, alg, aud, iss, tid allowlist, nonce, exp
  C->>C: find identity by tid and oid, load role
  C->>C: store session token hash
  C-->>A: session cookie (HttpOnly, Secure, SameSite)
  A-->>U: signed in
